 line) | `e22_stdout_shared_with_the_host` | [x] |\n| C33 | executables and `main` via `dlsym` | stdin is a **seekable file** that is only partially consumed: the descriptor position left behind, and what a following reader sees (11 measured offsets + 4 remainders) | `e20_stdin_offset_restored_at_exit`, `e24_next_reader_sees_the_remainder` | [x] |"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":513,"cache_read_input_tokens":242555,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":513,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":17,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f840c14a-a681-4b88-88b0-66464adaa41c","uuid":"f8b75951-bcac-4705-a956-a07d2e159f64","timestamp":"2026-08-18T10:54:33.636Z"}
